# Assistant content: streaming. internal/tui/stream.go's RenderStreamLive
# shows the in-flight text, rendered as markdown, with a trailing amber
# caret (theme.go's StreamCaret, "▍" in the fancy theme) while the turn is
# still arriving; a faux hold stops the reply partway until the scenario
# has captured it.
@faux testdata/faux/qa/content-streaming.yaml
@size 120x40

WAITFOR /describe a task/ 20
SHOT welcome
TYPE explain the change
KEY enter
WAITFOR /per-user bucket/ 20
SHOT mid-stream
EXPECT /▍/
RELEASE rest
WAITFOR /Nothing else in the upload path changed/ 20
SHOT reply-committed
EXPECT_NOT /▍/
EXPECT_NOT /panic|goroutine/
